 but a grounding theorist could still ask what fully explains that architecture and whether those deeper grounds necessitate its features.\\\",\n            \\\"parent_ref\\\": \\\"draft-2\\\",\n            \\\"score_assessment\\\": {\n                \\\"score\\\": 21,\n                \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Raises a relevant bridge concern grounded in the distinction between memory evidence and grounding theory.\\\"\n            }\n        }\n    ]\n}\n\nwith output_json_path.open('w', encoding='utf-8') as handle:\n    json.dump(payload, handle, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n    handle.write('\\\\n')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
